  "Saya Muhammad Rehan. Bagi saya, belajar teknologi terasa lebih dekat ketika bisa dicoba dan dikerjakan secara langsung.": "I am Muhammad Rehan. For me, learning about technology feels more tangible when I can try things out and work with them directly.",
